      "title": "Final dividend of ₹75.00 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹75.00. Ex-date: 24th July 2026 Payment date: 4th September 2026 Dividend yield will be 3.5%, which is higher than the industry average of 0.9%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by both earnings (64% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (51% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 12% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 23% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
